  "writing_rules": [
    "Load this template, the registered blank skeleton, and the teams/formations contract before creating or structurally editing a persistent team doctrine.",
    "A doctrine owner stores operational doctrine for exactly one saved team_id and does not grant techniques, equipment, mission authority, or knowledge by itself.",
    "Member IDs used in command, roles, phases, extraction, familiarity, training caps, or role focus must resolve to the saved team roster when the doctrine becomes active.",
